    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 47,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "APPROACH\n\nPrice rising into\nthe top of the box.\n\"watch my bid\" —\nfor a short, the\nbuyers are the\nopponent.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.464Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.464Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 192,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "TAG OR ABSORB\n\n\"Really want this\nto tag top of the\nJVA. If not, I want\nto see some\nabsorption like\nthis.\"",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.464Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.464Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 337,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "STEP AWAY = GO\n\n\"when that step\naway from the bid\nhappens ... that's\nwhere I would\nposition\"\nSHORT.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 482,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "STOP = THE EDGE\n\nJBA high 7272¾.\n\"there should be\nno risk above\nthe 73s.\"",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 627,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "FIRST TARGET\n\n7258 primary LVN,\nfirst structure\ninside the box.\n\"Get something\noff ... Gauge\ncontinuation.\"",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 772,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "SIT THROUGH IT\n\n\"the offer is still\nheavy and filling\n... Absorption\ntakes time.\"\nOwn side still\ndefending.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "version": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "w5_x7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 917,
      "y": 252,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 0,
      "text": "HOW IT DIES\n\nStop-run above\nand SETTLE above\nthe JBA highs:\n\"don't fight it.\nLet it move.\"",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-09-06T19:25:45.465Z",
      "version": 1
    },
